 "name": "Associate Director, Corporate Advisory & Consulting ",
 "description": {
  "company": "<div><body><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:16pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">About Eurasia Group and GZERO Media</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">  </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eurasia Group is the world's leading global research and advisory firm. We help clients understand, anticipate, and respond to instability and opportunities everywhere they do business. </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Together with GZERO Media—the go-to source of first insight into geopolitics—and our full-fledged events team, the Eurasia Group umbrella provides a complete political risk solution.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Headquartered in New York, we have offices in Washington, London, São Paulo, Brasilia, Tokyo, Singapore, and San Francisco, as well as on-the-ground experts in more than a hundred countries in every region of the world.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are committed to analysis that is free of political bias and the influence of private interests. </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Visit us: </span><a href=\"https://www.eurasiagroup.net/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">eurasiagroup.net</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://www.gzeromedia.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">gzeromedia.com</span></a></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Follow us: </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eurasia-group/mycompany/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">LinkedIn</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://twitter.com/EurasiaGroup\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">X</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://www.threads.net/@eurasia__group\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Threads</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/eurasiagroup\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Facebook</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/gzeromedia/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Instagram</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@GZEROMedia\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">YouTube</span></a></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p></body></div>",
  "role": "<div><body><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:16pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Position Overview</strong></b></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eurasia Group is seeking a mid level </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Associate Director, Corporate Advisory &amp; Consulting</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> to support the commercial team’s proposal process, strengthen follow-through from client engagements, and help develop high-quality client-facing materials.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This role will be based in </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Washington, DC</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> and will report to the </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Director, Corporate Advisory &amp; Consulting</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">. The Associate Director will serve as a cross-functional “hub” across commercial leadership, subject-matter experts, and internal partners—bringing strong project management, excellent client-service instincts, and expert-level PowerPoint capabilities to help advance business development and deliver polished outputs.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:16pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Responsibilities</strong></b></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Develop client-facing materials</strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Create first-draft PowerPoint decks for client meetings, proposals, and commercial pursuits.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Translate rough inputs (bullets, emails, analyst notes) into clean, structured slides with strong executive-level storytelling.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ensure decks align with team standards and are ready for senior review.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Occasional advisory content creation (slide-based)</strong></b></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Support the team with occasional advisory content development primarily in PowerPoint format (e.g., brief slide-based perspectives, meeting “leave-behinds,” and issue framing).</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Operate as a cross-functional coordinator</strong></b></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Work closely with colleagues across the firm to synthesize inputs efficiently and ensure stakeholders are aligned.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Maintain a high bar for responsiveness, organization, and professionalism in a fast-paced, client-oriented environment.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Proposal process support</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Coordinating proposal inputs across internal stakeholders (commercial leads, analysts, and other relevant teams).</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Drafting and editing proposal content and structuring narratives for clarity and impact.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Building and maintaining proposal timelines; scheduling internal check-ins and reviews to hit deadlines.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Supporting pricing/level-of-effort tables and other standard proposal components, in coordination with relevant internal partners.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Managing version control and quality control to ensure consistency, accuracy, and professional formatting.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Helping prepare submission-ready deliverables (primarily PowerPoint and supporting documents).</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Track client meeting follow-ups and action items</strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Capturing and maintaining an action-item tracker from client meetings and internal discussions.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Coordinating with relevant owners to ensure follow-ups are completed on time and to a high standard.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:normal;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Proactively flagging risks to timelines and helping unblock next steps.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:16pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Qualifications</strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Expert-level </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">PowerPoint</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> skills, including the ability to build clear, compelling decks quickly (structure, narrative flow, layout, and polish).</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Strong </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">writing, editing, and synthesis</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> skills; ability to turn complex inputs into crisp, client-ready language and slides.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Demonstrated </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">project management</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> capability (tracking deadlines, managing stakeholders, version control, and follow-through).</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Comfort working across teams and senior stakeholders in a </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">cross-functional</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> environment.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Strong client-service orientation, sound judgment, and ability to handle sensitive information discreetly.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">High attention to detail and quality control; consistent execution under tight deadlines.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Proficiency with common productivity tools (e.g., Microsoft Office suite) and comfort working with </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">CRM systems</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> (e.g., Salesforce or equivalent) and/or action-item tracking tools.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Interest in global affairs/political risk and how politics impacts business and corporate decision-making.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bachelor’s degree required; advanced degree a plus.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The applicable base salary range for this role is $100,000 to $115,000. </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The base pay offered will be determined on factors such as experience, skills, training, location, certifications, and education. Decisions will be determined on a case-by-case basis.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">At Eurasia Group, our mission is to provide the tools and understanding needed in a world where politics drives disruption. We put </span><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">politics first </strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">for our clients, and we aspire to be the leading place people come to find out about the world. This requires us to maintain a company</span><a href=\"https://www.eurasiagroup.net/our-values\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> culture</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> that puts people first. We are committed to fostering an environment that is empowering and globally minded. We firmly believe that bringing people with a variety of ideas and perspectives to the table makes our analysis stronger for our clients and creates a better workplace. Our leadership team is dedicated to embedding this approach into everything we do and how we lead because we care deeply about our work and our people. </span></p></body></div>"
 },
